#: admin/views/policy_assistant_html.php:982
msgid "If you are a controller or processor not established in the United Kingdom and this law applies to you, you must also designate in writing a representative in the United Kingdom (Art. 27 UK GDPR), unless you are a public authority or body, or your processing is occasional, does not include large-scale processing of special categories of data or data on criminal convictions and offenses, and is unlikely to result in a risk to the rights and freedoms of individuals. Generating privacy and cookie policies does not appoint the representative or otherwise fulfill this obligation."
